g “default callbacks”: C “built-in” functions that can be used for callbacks (though this is currently not used, it may be useful to e.g. implement Vim jobs/channels without tainting our API much and yet without having too much differences: e.g. `expr` request handler implemented as a VimL callback function will use VimL function context, but caller expects that `['eval', 'l']` is `['eval', 'g:l']` and not `['eval', 'l:l']`).\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/231489930/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ZyX-I","id":322097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjA5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/322097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I","html_url":"https://github.com/ZyX-I","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/231495924","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/5022#issuecomment-231495924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/5022","id":231495924,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIzMTQ5NTkyNA==","user":{"login":"bfredl","id":1363104,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjMxMDQ=","avatar_url":"https