ack_T`).\n\nI guess that the only variant which will make compiler give many warnings yet being basically the same thing as `char *` is `typedef struct {char name[]; } FunctionReference;`: while such struct is really just the same thing as `char *`  and can be casted from and to `char *`, compiler will not leave any place where `FunctionReference*` is assigned to `char *` or the opposite without an error.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/231501381/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ZyX-I","id":322097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjA5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/322097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I","html_url":"https://github.com/ZyX-I","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZyX-I/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":717654601,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50NzE3NjU0NjAx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/events/717654601","actor":{"login":"bfredl","id":1363104,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjMxMDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1363104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bfredl","html_url":"https://github.com/bfredl","followers_url":"https:/